{"id":8319868,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/merge_requests/1646","number":1646,"state":"merged","title":"增加对属性clampLimit的合法性校验","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-nn/pulls/1646","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-nn/pulls/1646/issues","body":"## 描述\n问题描述\n本次PR旨在增强DequantSwigluQuant算子的鲁棒性。原实现中，当clampLimit属性被设置为非正数、无穷大或非数值（NaN）时，可能导致后续计算出现未定义行为或错误。本次修改通过增加有效性校验来预防此类问题。\n\n修改方案描述\n在DequantSwigluQuantV35DskTiling::GetAttr()函数中，读取clampLimit属性后，新增了有效性校验逻辑。该校验使用std::isfinite函数确保该值为有限数值，并检查其是否大于0.0。若校验失败，则记录错误日志并返回失败状态，从而阻止后续基于无效值的计算流程，确保算子执行的正确性。同时在文档中新增约束说明。\n\n## 关联的Issue\n关联Issue [#891](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/issues/891) \n\n## 测试\n构造属性clampLimit为负数的异常场景进行测试，能够正确拦截。\n\n## 文档更新\n不涉及\n\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n\n\n","assignees_number":11,"assignees":[{"id":"688196a235dc04365328b7bc","login":"wangzitao_leo","name":"wangzitao","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fe/dc/9390f0e7d075c0371e84b437772a590e2018ffa99e821f7bdd524dc3b046e279.png?time=1762699622237","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wangzitao_leo","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","login":"zhou-qilong","name":"sunday","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6880d13aba419813105ac7ab","login":"tangweiwei2","name":"tangweiwei2","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822d43c24adff5452d7bec4","login":"zhajianqing123","name":"zhajianqing123","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhajianqing123","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c65c6a68fa1fec6cc32e","login":"crystalhu","name":"胡碧霞","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/crystalhu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c267402134ad667af2b58f","login":"wangyongguang","name":"wangyongguang","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wangyongg